---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
// t269: página legal. Sin NIF ni dirección postal (decisión de Alberto, t270). No es asesoramiento jurídico.
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy · Muntrume Motorsport" description="How Muntrume Motorsport processes personal data: data controller, purposes, legal basis, retention periods, and your rights (GDPR and LOPDGDD)." canonical="https://muntru.me/privacy">
  <section class="r-section lg" style="border-top:0;padding-top:clamp(104px,13vw,150px)" aria-labelledby="lgTitle">
    <div class="r-wrap lg-wrap">
      <nav class="r-meta" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/" style="color:inherit">Home</a> / <span>Legal Information</span></nav>
      <p class="r-kicker">Legal Information</p>
      <h1 id="lgTitle" class="r-h1 lg-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="r-meta">Last updated: November 13, 2026</p>
      <nav class="lg-tabs" aria-label="Legal Information"><a href="/aviso-legal">Legal Notice</a><a href="/privacy" aria-current="page">Privacy</a><a href="/cookies">Cookies</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></nav>
      <div class="lg-body">
      <h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">1. Data Controller</h2><dl class="lg-dl"><div><dt>Controller</dt><dd>Alberto Trujillo, owner of Muntrume Motorsport</dd></div><div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Barcelona (Spain)</dd></div><div><dt>Contact &amp; Rights</dt><dd><a href="mailto:info@muntru.me">info@muntru.me</a></dd></div></dl><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">2. What Data We Process and Why</h2><ul class="lg-list"><li>Setup Vault access requests and accounts: name, email address, iRacing ID, and category, used to review requests, create your account, and authenticate you.</li><li>Contact form: name, email address, and message, used to reply to your inquiry.</li><li>Public driver profile: racing name, photo, country, and public iRacing statistics, only for team drivers who explicitly authorize it.</li><li>Team communications (setup and event newsletters): email address and preferences, only when you opt in.</li><li>Security: IP address and technical logs retained for a limited time to prevent abuse and enforce rate limits.</li><li>MMT Sync desktop app: stores your authentication token locally in the Windows Credential Manager and only reads/syncs your local iRacing setup and telemetry folders when you trigger it.</li></ul><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">3. Legal Basis</h2><p>Performance of your relationship with the team and the access you request (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR), consent for public driver profiles and optional communications (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), and legitimate interest in keeping the service secure (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">4. Data Retention</h2><p>We keep your data while you remain associated with the team or until you request deletion. Rejected access requests and contact messages are deleted once they are no longer needed.</p><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">5. Service Providers (Data Processors)</h2><p>We use Cloudflare (servers and database), GitHub Pages (website hosting), Resend (email delivery), and Google Gemini / Groq (AI assistant, processing only the prompts you submit in chat). Some providers may process data outside the European Economic Area under GDPR safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses. We never sell or share your personal data for commercial purposes.</p><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">6. Your Rights</h2><p>You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction of processing, and data portability, or withdraw consent at any time, by emailing info@muntru.me with the subject line "Privacy". We will respond within one month.</p><p>If you believe your request has not been properly addressed, you may file a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (AEPD).</p><p><a class="r-link" href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aepd.es</a></p><h2 class="r-h3 lg-h">7. Emails We Send</h2><p>Security emails (verification codes, password resets) are necessary to operate the service. Setup and event notifications are optional: every email includes a one-click unsubscribe link and a link to choose what you want to receive.</p><p><a class="r-link" href="/email-preferences">Manage email preferences</a></p>
      <p class="r-meta lg-note">This text is provided for informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
